    dct:description "Credit: `--self-test` passes 11/11 checks in 5.3 s (L2030-2152), including the Pass 3 JSON SHA pin and 13-constant JSON/code parity (L2095-2100), section phi = 0.50 and single connected solid, monolith onset calibration, convergence / gamma / tau bounds for every depth, lattice < monolith twinning, bitwise FEM determinism and bitwise templating determinism; the default render completes in 8.5 s and the growth GIF is byte-identical after re-render; the loop telemetry run exists with ledger artifacts. Deductions: the FEM determinism check runs on a reduced 60-element mesh (L2121-2123), not the default 120-element mesh (-2); self-test tolerances are loose and partly self-fulfilling — `domains_templated_max = 2`, `domains_primary_ablation_min = 50`, IoU margin 0.15 (L2127-2131, JSON L70-72) and the specimen assertions phi ~ 0.5187 / a_0 ~ 14.80 (L2078-2079) test the script's own Pass 2 outputs (-3); `docs/media/*.png` are gitignored so the comparison and FEM PNGs are not tracked and the repro package relies on regeneration (-2); no requirements lock file is cited for this slot (-1). Unchanged from v2." ;
